  a_i: the arbitrary integer residue prescribed modulo m_i
  c_i: the product of the coefficients r_ij for fixed i
  d: the least element of S
  e_i: the selector integer c_i N_i
  k: the positive number of congruences
  m_i: the i-th modulus; the moduli are integers greater than 1 and are pairwise coprime
  n: the difference x-y
